      "body": "After digging a little bit more into the test, I've noticed that regarding `PSBT_GLOBAL_VERSION` there is a case that is not coverd and we could add to this test:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n      psbt.g.map[PSBT_GLOBAL_VERSION] = (1).to_bytes(4, \"little\")\r\n      assert_raises_rpc_error(-22, \"TX decode failed There is no PSBT version 1\", self.nodes[0].decodepsbt, psbt.to_base64())\r\n```\r\nThis is the line where the error is thrown in `psbt.h`: https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/9bf4815b94b9eaf8807f4e569091778da6c338d5/src/psbt.h#L1539",
